Phir Aur Kya Chahiye Guitar Chords easy lesson with strumming pattern, sung by Arijit Singh from Bollywood Hindi movie Zara Hatke Zara Bachke.

Strumming Pattern: D D UUD DDU

Chords Used: Am, C, Dm, G, F, E

[Am]Badle Tere Maahi,        [Am]Laa Ke Jo Koi Saari
Duniya Bhi [Dm]De De Agar [F]To,        Kise [G]Duniya Chahiye

